  "label": "audience description",
  "description": "The target audience is individuals who hold or are influenced by right-wing, conservative, or populist ideologies in the United States, particularly those who believe in conspiratorial narratives that falsely link progressive political groups (Democrats and Liberals) to violent extremist groups. The meme is designed to appeal to this audience by invoking fear of perceived threats to traditional values, using stereotypes about LGBTQ+ individuals and women, and falsely attributing support to Western political ideologies. It leverages existing cultural and political tensions to incite hatred and reinforce divisive narratives.",
